 body=[('Why recirculating water needs attention',['A/C plants reuse the same water again and again. As water evaporates or is topped up, minerals concentrate, and the loop slowly collects scale, corrosion products and biological growth. All three insulate heat exchanger surfaces, so the plant draws more power for the same cooling.','A treatment programme for the recirculating system keeps that water in a condition where these problems are held back.']),
  ('Dosed from your water analysis',['Lahore and Punjab groundwater varies widely in hardness and TDS, so there is no single correct dose. Seamens tests your make-up and circulating water and sets the FC-3020 programme from those results, then reviews it on follow-up visits.'])],
